<title>UK: SBC sets warrants on Novartis.</title>
<headline>SBC sets warrants on Novartis.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp, Basel has issued three million American-style call warrants, on Novartis registered shares, lead manager Schweizerischer Bankverein said.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    2350 CHF		  PREMIUM	12.80 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     3.89 DEM		  GEARING	7.3 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 07.JUL.97-15.DEC.98   PAYDATE	04.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFURT, DUSS	     MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  2.373 CHF     1.0 CHF = 1.1930 DEM</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
